# Evidence and validation

Evidence files are under this directory's evidence/. Installed functional logs name the actual loaded roots. Source hashes and registry metadata are retained. Full local test sweep deliberately not run; hosted CI and Publish ran their configured suites. Prior real-client synthetic E2E was inspected, not rerun against the installed version; installed checks use scripted upstream iterables, not sockets or a real client.

The actual skill validator ignores .okf extension (zero concepts); first console attempt also failed cp1252 output. Re-ran its deterministic checker on temporary .md projections of both journal contents with UTF-8; 2 concepts conformant, no errors, optional-field warnings only. Final release journal projection validated again before follow-up commit.

The closed-block + stop_reason but absent message_stop discrepancy remains: the synthetic real client accepted Done. while router delivery failed. Do not equate this release with correcting that client interpretation or proving historical gateway termination causes.
